    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "It is said that dogs are man’s best friend. But for one animal lover, a lion is his best friend."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Frikkie Von Solns has taken care of a 16-year-old lion since it was born. The lion’s name is Zion."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Zion’s mother was in a zoo when she "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gave birth to",
            "ref": "v-give-birth-to"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " him. Zion was taken away from his mother because people feared his father would hurt him. Frikkie brought the baby lion up. When he was young, Zion needed "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "feeding",
            "ref": "v-feed"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " every four hours. At that time, Frikkie even shared a bed with the lion."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“I have learned so much from Zion,” Frikkie said, “It is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "once-in-a-lifetime",
            "zh": "一生仅有一次的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " experience to grow up with him. Zion is a gentle big cat. He has never hurt a human. I "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "trust",
            "ref": "v-trust"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " him.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Frikkie and Zion love taking walks together. But before their walks, Frikkie always takes his shoes off because Zion doesn’t like the noises they make. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "bond",
            "ref": "v-bond"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " between the two is very strong."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The friendship between Frikkie and Zion is really special. But as "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "normal",
            "ref": "v-normal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people, we should be careful around lions and other wild animals."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
